 "titulo": "Why sidewalks have lines every few feet 🧱 #howitworks #shorts",
 "capa": "WHY THE LINES?",
 "descripcion": "Those grooves in the sidewalk are not decoration. They tell the concrete exactly where to crack.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #concrete #science #shorts",
 "tags": [
  "how it works",
